      <p>The AI-native organisation, one idea at a time. Start with The Layer Underneath.</p>
      <span class="m-link">All essays →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="m-next-card" href="/library/">
      <span class="m-eyebrow">Reading and notes</span>
      <h3>Browse the library</h3>
      <p>What I’m reading and listening to, tested against what I’ve built.</p>
      <span class="m-link">Open the library →</span>
